[ti:I Made This]
[ar:Mippithedork]
[offset:-300]

[00:03.49]Ladies and gentlemen,
[00:05.70]The future of gaming!
[00:07.81]No team, no code, no experience.
[00:12.02]Just me...
[00:14.53]And a very detailed prompt.
[00:22.69]I don't need a programmer,
[00:23.77]I don't need a team
[00:24.88]Got an AI building
[00:25.99]Everything I dream
[00:27.03]Type a couple sentences,
[00:28.04]Watch the magic flow
[00:29.29]Been developing for weeks,
[00:30.53]I'm a CEO!
[00:31.84]Combat from Dark Souls,
[00:32.84]Loot from Diablo
[00:34.07]Farming from Stardew,
[00:35.27]Guns from Halo
[00:36.67]Put 'em all together,
[00:37.61]That's innovation!
[00:38.94]Everybody's jealous
[00:39.87]Of my imagination!
[00:41.19]They say "That's been done,"
[00:42.40]I say "Not by me!"
[00:43.59]Brand-new concept, legally!
[00:45.83]Call it inspiration,
[00:46.91]Call it destiny
[00:48.19]I call it intellectual property!
[00:51.13]Ooh, they say it doesn't fit
[00:53.16]But baby, I don't give a shit!
[00:55.44]If one good mechanic
[00:56.40]Makes a game feel fine
[00:58.40]Then twenty-seven
[00:59.18]Oughta blow your mind!
[01:00.29]I MADE THIS! I MADE THIS!
[01:02.44]He made this! All by himself!
[01:04.93]Every little feature, every little bit!
[01:07.06]I just told the AI what to do with it!
[01:09.57]I MADE THIS! I MADE THIS!
[01:11.62]He made this! Can't you tell?
[01:14.13]A hundred different games
[01:15.13]All rolled into one!
[01:16.19]I ain't even played it, but I KNOW it's fun!
[01:18.73]Who had the vision?
[01:19.75]YOU DID!
[01:20.80]Who wrote the code?
[01:22.03]AI DID!
[01:23.11]Who gets the credit?
[01:24.47]YOU DO!
[01:25.45]Who's gonna fix it?
[01:26.75]NOT YOU!
[01:27.86]It's a cozy horror roguelike racing sim
[01:29.86]With a turn-based battle royale you can win
[01:32.26]Permadeath for casuals, checkpoints for pros
[01:34.52]And a farming minigame wherever you go!
[01:36.99]Single-player MMO, multiplayer optional
[01:39.44]Competitive meditation, that's phenomenal!
[01:41.81]Skill tree for fishing, battle pass for sleep
[01:43.87]A thousand little features that I got for free!
[01:46.47]Designer said, "Your systems don't connect"
[01:48.65]I said, "Sounds like somebody feels disrespected!"
[01:51.03]He asked, "What's the core loop?"
[01:52.41]I said, "All of 'em, man!"
[01:53.71]"You're just a worker, I'm the one with the plan!"
[01:55.82]Ooh, they wanna test my game
[01:57.88]But I already know it's great!
[02:00.31]If players don't enjoy it,
[02:01.55]Here's what I'll do:
[02:02.54]Tell the AI, "Make the fun times two!"
[02:05.61]I MADE THIS! I MADE THIS!
[02:07.31]He made this? Well, so he says!
[02:10.11]Every little feature, every little bit!
[02:12.27]I just told the AI what to do with it!
[02:14.60]I MADE THIS! I MADE THIS!
[02:16.59]He made this... more or less!
[02:19.21]A hundred different games
[02:19.98]All rolled into one!
[02:21.25]I ain't even played it, but I KNOW it's fun!
[02:33.20]Hundred thousand lines, ain't read a single one
[02:35.18]Asked the AI "Does it work?" It said "Job done!"
[02:37.59]Main menu crashed, critical exception
[02:39.91]So I prompted up a sequel, that's forward direction!
[02:42.41]Testers said it crashes, I said "Skill issue, bro!"
[02:44.68]"There's no tutorial!" That's how legends grow!
[02:47.20]"The game ain't fun!" You're playing it wrong!
[02:49.32]Blocked 'em all and wrote a victory song!
[02:51.96]Steam page, logo, cinematic trailer
[02:53.97]One wishlist from Mom, one comment from a hater
[02:56.17]"You haven't made a game!" Buddy, that's a lie!
[02:58.57]Got forty-seven builds in my Downloads file!
[03:02.42]Problem with the games industry?
[03:05.03]Too many people who think you gotta... know things.
[03:09.10]They spent their whole lives learning
[03:11.61]I spent a weekend typing
[03:13.87]They say the game is broken
[03:16.43]I say they're just not vibing!
[03:19.28]Oh, he's a genius!
[03:21.50]He THINKS he's a genius!
[03:24.09]Why spend ten years making games
[03:26.07]When I can make ten games tonight?
[03:28.78]TEN GAMES TONIGHT!
[03:31.41]Does it work? Don't know.
[03:32.92]DON'T KNOW!
[03:33.55]Is it fun?
[03:34.16]DON'T KNOW!
[03:34.74]Did you test it?
[03:35.35]HELL NO!
[03:35.90]Is it ready?
[03:36.49]LET'S GO!
[03:39.53]I MADE THIS! I MADE THIS!
[03:41.46]The AI made this! You just described it!
[03:44.33]Every little feature, every little bit!
[03:46.34]I just told the AI what to do with it!
[03:48.81]I MADE THIS! I MADE THIS!
[03:50.85]He THINKS he made this! Somebody stop him!
